From cbae81c721aa944a0e41f38327824db6dc64df27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hapto <alex-88-3@hotmail.fr>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:19:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Refine timers with public OctoWoW Chronicle data

Second pass using ~70 kills per MC/ZG boss, 43 Onyxia kills and 45
Lower Karazhan clears pulled from Chronicle's external API.

- Shazzrah: later Gates of Shazzrah every 7-21s on OctoWoW (was 30-35)
- Onyxia: landing roar -> first fear window 16-31s
- Hazza'rah: sleep repeats every ~23-25s on OctoWoW
- Thekal: Force Punch 16-20s
- Mandokir: first charge at 14s
- Araxxna: volley interval bars
- Lord Blackwald II: Reaver Storm 6.5-14s
- Moroes: first Glittering Dust 21-26s
- Grizikil: new "Next Flamewave" bar (first 30-33s, then 27-32s)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WJLQrM2ob1poW3peUyML4T
---
